hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1083","Chapter on the age at which a boy leaves the category of offspring, 1121 - Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Wahb ibn Jarir narrated to us, he said: Shu'bah narrated to us, from Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr, from Atiyyah al-Qurazi, who said: On the day of Banu Qurayzah they would look at a man's pubic hair; if it had grown they killed him, and if it had not grown they spared him. They looked at my hair and it had not grown, so they spared me."
